OL,3,CProgramme listings for THU 4 JUN
OL,4,G1300FClassical Live
OL,5,     GA live song recital from Wigmore
OL,6,     GHall of Mahler, Strauss and
OL,7,     GDebussy marking the venue's 125th
OL,8,     Ganniversary and Brahms's First
OL,9,     GSymphony from one of the world's
OL,10,     Gforemost conductors.
OL,11,G1600FComposer of the Week: Arthur Bliss
OL,12,     GDonald Macleod with biographer
OL,13,     GPaul Spicer delve into Bliss's
OL,14,     Gmusic during WWII and after,
OL,15,     Gincluding his appointment as
OL,16,     GMaster of the Queen's Music.
OL,17,G1700FIn Tune
OL,18,     GPetroc introduces live music from
OL,19,     Gthe Scottish Chamber Orchestra
OL,20,     Gcello ensemble ahead of the
OL,21,     GScottish Chamber Orchestra's
OL,22,     Gsummer tour.
