OL,3,CProgramme listings for THU 4 JUN
OL,4,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,5,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,6,     Gsoundscape of classical music.
OL,7,G1930FRadio 3 in Concert
OL,8,     GAs part of Wigmore Hall's 125th
OL,9,     GAnniversary Festival, Canadian
OL,10,     Gpianist Angela Hewitt plays
OL,11,     GMozart, Beethoven, Schubert,
OL,12,     GHaydn and Bach.
OL,13,G2145FThe Essay: The Other
OL,14,     FShostakoviches
OL,15,     GChris Addison explores the ill-
OL,16,     Gfated life of the hard-drinking,
OL,17,     Gcigar-smoking wildman of Soviet
OL,18,     Gmusic Alexander Mosolov - whose
OL,19,     Gcareer was interrupted by a spell
OL,20,     Gin the gulag.
